---
title: APIM
endpoints:
  - name: APIM Console
    url: http://localhost:30080
    when: '{{ not (hasFlag "disable-ui") }}'
  - name: APIM Portal
    url: http://localhost:30081
    when: '{{ and (not (hasFlag "disable-portal")) (not (hasFlag "disable-ui")) }}'
  - name: APIM Gateway
    url: http://localhost:30082
  - name: APIM Gateway (TLS)
    url: https://localhost:30084
  - name: APIM API
    url: http://localhost:30083
  - name: APIM Bridge API
    url: http://localhost:30085
    when: '{{ hasFlag "enable-bridge" }}'
---
Everything has been deployed in the `gravitee` namespace.
{{ if hasFlag "enable-hc-vault" }}
Vault is deployed in dev mode (root token: root). To access the Vault API/UI
from your host:

  kubectl port-forward svc/vault -n gravitee 8200:8200
{{ end -}}
